# auto-api-go

Go client for the auto-api.com vehicle data API.

- Go 1.21+, stdlib only, zero dependencies
- Single Client struct with 6 public methods
- context.Context as first parameter of every method
- Errors via return (value, error), use errors.As() to check type
- PascalCase for exported names
- OfferItem.Data is json.RawMessage — varies between sources
- `api_key` in query string for GET, `x-api-key` header for POST
- English godoc comments

## Never

- Add external dependencies (no third-party packages)
- Use panic for error handling
- Use init() functions
- Add unnecessary interfaces or abstractions
